{"page":273,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:55","surah":16,"ayah":55,"ar_uthmani":"لِيَكْفُرُوا۟ بِمَآ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ ۚ فَتَمَتَّعُوا۟ ۖ فَسَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Let them show ingratitude for the favours We have shown them; ‘Enjoy your brief time- soon you will know.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِيَكْفُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"So as to deny","transliteration":"liyakfurū","verse_key":"16:55"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"that which","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"16:55"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"We have given them","transliteration":"ātaynāhum","verse_key":"16:55"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَتَمَتَّعُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"Then enjoy yourselves","transliteration":"fatamattaʿū","verse_key":"16:55"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَسَوْفَ","en_gloss":"soon","transliteration":"fasawfa","verse_key":"16:55"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"you will know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"16:55"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٥٥","en_gloss":"(55)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:55"}]},{"verse_key":"16:56","surah":16,"ayah":56,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَجْعَلُونَ لِمَا لَا يَعْلَمُونَ نَصِيبًا مِّمَّا رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ ۗ تَٱللَّهِ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ عَمَّا كُنتُمْ تَفْتَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They set aside part of the sustenance We give them, for [idols] about which they have no true knowledge. By God! You will be questioned about your false inventions.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَجْعَلُونَ","en_gloss":"And they assign","transliteration":"wayajʿalūna","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِمَا","en_gloss":"to what","transliteration":"limā","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"they know ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَصِيبًۭا","en_gloss":"a portion","transliteration":"naṣīban","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"We have provided them","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"By Allah","transliteration":"tal-lahi","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ","en_gloss":"surely you will be asked","transliteration":"latus'alunna","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَمَّا","en_gloss":"about what","transliteration":"ʿammā","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used (to)","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَفْتَرُونَ","en_gloss":"invent","transliteration":"taftarūna","verse_key":"16:56"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:56"}]},{"verse_key":"16:57","surah":16,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَجْعَلُونَ لِلَّهِ ٱلْبَنَـٰتِ سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۙ وَلَهُم مَّا يَشْتَهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They assign daughters to God––may He be exalted!––and the [sons] they desire to themselves.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَجْعَلُونَ","en_gloss":"And they assign","transliteration":"wayajʿalūna","verse_key":"16:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"16:57"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْبَنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"daughters","transliteration":"l-banāti","verse_key":"16:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۙ","en_gloss":"Glory be to Him","transliteration":"sub'ḥānahu","verse_key":"16:57"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَهُم","en_gloss":"And for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"16:57"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"16:57"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَشْتَهُونَ","en_gloss":"they desire","transliteration":"yashtahūna","verse_key":"16:57"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٥٧","en_gloss":"(57)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:57"}]},{"verse_key":"16:58","surah":16,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا بُشِّرَ أَحَدُهُم بِٱلْأُنثَىٰ ظَلَّ وَجْهُهُۥ مُسْوَدًّا وَهُوَ كَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When one of them is given news of the birth of a baby girl, his face darkens and he is filled with gloom.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"16:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بُشِّرَ","en_gloss":"is given good news","transliteration":"bushira","verse_key":"16:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَحَدُهُم","en_gloss":"(to) one of them","transliteration":"aḥaduhum","verse_key":"16:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْأُنثَىٰ","en_gloss":"of a female","transliteration":"bil-unthā","verse_key":"16:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ظَلَّ","en_gloss":"turns","transliteration":"ẓalla","verse_key":"16:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَجْهُهُۥ","en_gloss":"his face","transliteration":"wajhuhu","verse_key":"16:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُسْوَدًّۭا","en_gloss":"dark","transliteration":"mus'waddan","verse_key":"16:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and he","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"16:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَظِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"suppresses grief","transliteration":"kaẓīmun","verse_key":"16:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:58"}]},{"verse_key":"16:59","surah":16,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"يَتَوَٰرَىٰ مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ مِن سُوٓءِ مَا بُشِّرَ بِهِۦٓ ۚ أَيُمْسِكُهُۥ عَلَىٰ هُونٍ أَمْ يَدُسُّهُۥ فِى ٱلتُّرَابِ ۗ أَلَا سَآءَ مَا يَحْكُمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In his shame he hides himself away from his people because of the bad news he has been given. Should he keep her and suffer contempt or bury her in the dust? How ill they judge!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَتَوَٰرَىٰ","en_gloss":"He hides himself","transliteration":"yatawārā","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawmi","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(because) of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سُوٓءِ","en_gloss":"the evil","transliteration":"sūi","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بُشِّرَ","en_gloss":"he has been given good news","transliteration":"bushira","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَيُمْسِكُهُۥ","en_gloss":"Should he keep it","transliteration":"ayum'sikuhu","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُونٍ","en_gloss":"humiliation","transliteration":"hūnin","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَدُسُّهُۥ","en_gloss":"bury it","transliteration":"yadussuhu","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلتُّرَابِ ۗ","en_gloss":"the dust","transliteration":"l-turābi","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَلَا","en_gloss":"Unquestionably","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":17,"ar":"سَآءَ","en_gloss":"evil","transliteration":"sāa","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَحْكُمُونَ","en_gloss":"they decide","transliteration":"yaḥkumūna","verse_key":"16:59"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٥٩","en_gloss":"(59)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:59"}]},{"verse_key":"16:60","surah":16,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ مَثَلُ ٱلسَّوْءِ ۖ وَلِلَّهِ ٱلْمَثَلُ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who do not believe in the Hereafter should have the contemptible image, and God should have the highest one: He is the Mighty, the Wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"For those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"in the Hereafter","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَثَلُ","en_gloss":"(is) a similitude","transliteration":"mathalu","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلسَّوْءِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the evil","transliteration":"l-sawi","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"and for Allah","transliteration":"walillahi","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمَثَلُ","en_gloss":"(is) the similitude","transliteration":"l-mathalu","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ ۚ","en_gloss":"the Highest","transliteration":"l-aʿlā","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","verse_key":"16:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٦٠","en_gloss":"(60)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:60"}]},{"verse_key":"16:61","surah":16,"ayah":61,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ يُؤَاخِذُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلنَّاسَ بِظُلْمِهِم مَّا تَرَكَ عَلَيْهَا مِن دَآبَّةٍ وَلَـٰكِن يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ إِلَىٰٓ أَجَلٍ مُّسَمًّى ۖ فَإِذَا جَآءَ أَجَلُهُمْ لَا يَسْتَـْٔخِرُونَ سَاعَةً ۖ وَلَا يَسْتَقْدِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If God took people to task for the evil they do, He would not leave one living creature on earth, but He reprieves them until an appointed time: when their time comes they cannot delay it for a moment nor can they bring it forward.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"16:61"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُؤَاخِذُ","en_gloss":"Allah were to seize","transliteration":"yuākhidhu","verse_key":"16:61"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah were to seize","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"16:61"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"the mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"16:61"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِظُلْمِهِم","en_gloss":"for their wrongdoing","trans